[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0855","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0855.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1254","title":"OpenSSL RSA密钥生成弱漏洞","description":"OpenSSL 0.9.6 之前版本中 crypto/rsa/rsa_gen.c 文件存在 RSA 密钥生成缺陷，在处理超过表达式大小的 C 语言位运算移位操作时发生错误，导致在 64 位 HP-UX 平台上生成的 RSA 密钥强度不足。远程攻击者可利用此漏洞更容易地破解加密保护机制，获取敏感信息。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响 OpenSSL 版本的系统，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程利用，危害较大。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1254"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2016-05-05T01:59:00.137","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:27.853","remediation":"升级 OpenSSL 至 0.9.6 或更高版本。如无法升级，在 64 位 HP-UX 平台上避免使用 RSA 密钥生成功能，或改用其他加密库（如 LibreSSL）替代。同时限制对受影响服务的网络访问，仅允许可信来源连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=openssl-users&m=95961024500509","http://www-01.ibm.com/support/docview.wss?uid=swg21995039","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2016/05/04/17","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/90109","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1035750","https://git.openssl.org/?p=openssl.git%3Ba=commit%3Bh=db82b8f9bd432a59aea8e1014694e15fc457c2bb","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-1254.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1254.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1254","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/75471602a53215062ddbaeb95f039a60b664c3d0/vex/cve/2000/CVE-2000-1254.json","https://github.com/entrysky/mageni/blob/c58dcc9bc43b7fb267bb10a8083ada356fbc81d1/plugins/2020/openssl/gb_openssl_CVE-2000-1254.nasl","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CVE-2000-1254-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/secure-software-engineering/achilles-benchmark-depscanners/blob/78b391f47cbe64adf7a2e2182ff94be604eb94dd/detection/CVE-2000-1254__org.jruby_openssl_0.9.4.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2000-1254","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9608541b971a314a928294c8f88371b45ef3f307/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-m8gw-x5jx-r3vm/GHSA-m8gw-x5jx-r3vm.json","https://github.com/trietptm/Security-News/blob/e46fe769bfa56f60b70561bb4b637851150da4d0/Twitter/Zube/2016/2016_12_20.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0855.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0937","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0937.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1208","title":"BSD lpr/lpd 格式化字符串本地权限提升漏洞","description":"BSD 系 Unix 系统中 lpr/lpd 打印服务的 printjob.c 文件内的 startprinting() 函数存在格式化字符串漏洞。该函数在调用 syslog 记录日志时，错误地将 checkremote() 函数返回的不可信数据直接作为格式化字符串参数使用，而非作为普通字符串参数传递。本地攻击者可通过构造特制的打印任务请求，向该函数传递包含格式化说明符的恶意字符串，触发格式化字符串漏洞，从而以 lp 守护进程权限执行任意代码，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响多个 BSD 衍生系统，攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1208"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:23.083","remediation":"立即安装 Red Hat RHSA-2000-066 安全更新，或升级 lpr/lpd 至修复了 syslog 格式化字符串漏洞的版本。对于 BSD 系统，请应用对应厂商补丁或升级至修复后的 lpr 包。临时缓解措施：限制本地用户对打印机系统的访问权限，移除不必要的 lpd 服务 setuid 位。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96994604300675&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/137555","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/5286.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-066.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1711","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1208.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1208","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-1208.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1208.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/74884340187670a91b9d5bdb799b52e73426ad63/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x8pj-r335-vm92/GHSA-x8pj-r335-vm92.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1711/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_148800_148900.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--57615c5f-fa57-49ff-9d6b-52f8c60a39fa.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/mandrake_MDKSA-2000-054.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1208.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0937.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0844","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0844.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1209","title":"Microsoft SQL Server sa账户默认空口令权限提升漏洞","description":"`sa` 账户默认空口令是 Microsoft SQL Server 2000、SQL Server 7.0 及 MSDE 1.0 的安全配置缺陷。远程攻击者可利用该账户无需认证直接登录数据库，执行任意 SQL 语句进而完全控制服务器。该漏洞影响范围广泛，包括使用这些数据库产品的 Compaq Insight Manager、Tumbleweed Secure Mail、Visio 2000 等第三方软件。蠕虫病毒 Voyager Alpha Force 与 Spida 已在野外利用此漏洞进行大规模传播。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1209"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:23.207","remediation":"立即为 SQL Server 的 sa 账户设置强密码（至少 12 位含大小写字母、数字和特殊字符），或禁用 sa 账户并改用 Windows 身份验证模式。在 SQL Server Management Studio 中执行：ALTER LOGIN sa WITH PASSWORD = '强密码'; ALTER LOGIN sa DISABLE;。同时排查并删除所有使用空密码的 SQL Server 账户，确保数据库连接字符串不硬编码 sa 凭据。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96333895000350&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96593218804850&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96644570412692&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/273639","http://security-archive.merton.ox.ac.uk/bugtraq-200008/0233.html","http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ313418","http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3BEN-US%3Bq321081","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/1459.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/635463","http://www.microsoft.com/security/security_bulletins/ms02020_sql.asp","http://www.osvdb.org/3570","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4797","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/16394","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-1209.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f655f864c18bd25e1fca21f5741c644854233bf0/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1209.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1209","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2000/CVE-2000-1209.rules","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be9b320c2a949cb73c32157503bdf6fad99f369e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1209.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1209.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hwwv-vx36-7jpp/GHSA-hwwv-vx36-7jpp.json","https://github.com/Chudry/Xerror/blob/07ec57cabcd27cdb47c89af452bdf4ed07207347/xerror/parsing/msf_module_result/msf_module_cve.txt","https://github.com/KvasirSecurity/Kvasir/blob/a5b3775184a8343240e1154a1f762f75df04dc0a/static/etc/canvas_exploits.xml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0844.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0933","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0933.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1191","title":"htDig htsearch 物理路径信息泄露漏洞","description":"htDig 的 htsearch 程序在处理 config 参数时存在信息泄露漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过向 config 参数传入一个不存在的配置文件路径，即可触发程序返回包含服务器完整物理路径的错误消息，从而泄露目标系统的目录结构信息。该漏洞影响 htDig 3.2 beta、3.1.6、3.1.5 及更早版本，攻击复杂度低，可为进一步渗透提供信息支撑。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1191"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-08-31T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:20.877","remediation":"升级到 ht://Dig 3.2.0b6 或更高版本（SourceForge 可下载），该版本修复了路径泄露问题。如无法升级，修改 htdig 配置文件中 error_page 指令，将错误页面重定向到自定义模板而非显示默认错误信息；同时在 Web 服务器（Apache/Nginx）层面配置 ServerTokens Prod 和 ServerSignature Off 以抑制路径信息输出。由于 ht://Dig 项目已停止维护，建议迁移至 Lucene/Nutch 等活跃维护的搜索引擎替代。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securiteam.com/exploits/htDig_reveals_web_server_configuration_paths.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4366","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7367","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A10526","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1191.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1191","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-1191.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1191.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c91b667a34faaae3b0a33048a22e9eae624cf0e4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7c6m-w964-4jjh/GHSA-7c6m-w964-4jjh.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/htsearch_location.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1191.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5c912af4-8a5e-43cd-a74f-8adaf10398cc.json","https://github.com/Vie4567/Pentest-automation-tool/blob/6c7afc034d6abf1d8a4b3617c36d74273c5b179f/Final_Security_Report.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/864adb9ddf294417a5a4e84f90f9adf54e9dca89/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0933.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0843","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0843.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1199","title":"PostgreSQL 明文密码存储漏洞","description":"PostgreSQL 在 pg_shadow 和 pg_pwd 文件中以明文形式存储数据库用户名和密码，具有足够权限的攻击者（如数据库管理员或系统管理员）可直接读取这些文件获取所有用户凭据，进而访问其他数据库账户。该漏洞影响 PostgreSQL 6.3.2 及 6.5.3 版本，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。由于密码未经过任何加密或哈希处理，内部攻击者利用难度较低，建议升级至修复版本或采用外部认证机制。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1199"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-08-31T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:21.847","remediation":"升级 PostgreSQL 至 7.1 或更高版本（该版本起默认使用 MD5 加密存储密码）。如无法升级，在 postgresql.conf 中设置 password_encryption = md5 并重启服务，同时将 pg_hba.conf 中的认证方式改为 md5 而非 password。作为临时缓解措施，使用 chmod 600 限制 pg_shadow 和 pg_pwd 文件的系统权限，仅允许 postgres 系统用户读取。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95659987018649&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1139","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4364","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19875","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1199.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1199","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-1199.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1199.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ece131eb82ceb38a160571408bcbbb92bfa0f3c0/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9ccp-985w-grj6/GHSA-9ccp-985w-grj6.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/1xxx/cve-2000-1199.yaml","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1139/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1199.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151200_151300.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0843.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0839","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0839.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1196","title":"Netscape PublishingXpert 本地文件读取漏洞","description":"Netscape PublishingXpert 2.0/2.2/2.5 版本中的 PSCOErrPage.htm 组件存在本地文件读取漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 errPagePath 参数指定目标文件路径，读取服务器上的任意文件内容，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 SP2 之前的 2.5 版本及更早版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。建议升级至 SP2 或更高版本进行修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1196"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-31T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:21.507","remediation":"升级 Netscape PublishingXpert 至 2.5 SP2 及以上版本；对 PSCOErrPage.htm 页面实施输入验证，过滤 errPagePath 参数中的路径遍历字符（如 ../），限制文件访问范围至指定目录，同时配置 Web 服务器 ACL 禁止未经授权访问该页面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://docs.iplanet.com/docs/manuals/pubx/2.5.2_Relnotes.html","http://packetstormsecurity.org/0004-exploits/ooo1.txt","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7362","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20966","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-1196.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f655f864c18bd25e1fca21f5741c644854233bf0/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1196.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1196","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be9b320c2a949cb73c32157503bdf6fad99f369e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1196.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1196.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pxq6-g7mh-m75f/GHSA-pxq6-g7mh-m75f.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1196.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151200_151300.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--2e2969d0-1d98-48e1-85e9-ef25ba0cb13a.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0839.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0838","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0838.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1193","title":"SGI IRIX 6.5.x Performance Co-Pilot 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 6.x 系统中的 Performance Copilot 性能监控组件所包含的 PMCD（Performance Metrics Collector Daemon）存在资源耗尽型拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向 PMCD 端口发送特制超长字符串，导致目标系统资源被大量消耗，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 IRIX 6.3/6.4/6.5 等版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1193"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-31T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:21.170","remediation":"立即应用 SGI 安全公告 20020407-01-I 提供的补丁更新 Performance Co-Pilot。如无法立即打补丁，在防火墙或主机 ACL 中限制 PMCD 端口（默认 4321/tcp）仅允许可信 IP 访问，或停止并禁用 PMCD 服务（`/etc/init.d/pmcd stop; chkconfig pmcd off`）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0056.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4284","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21431","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fe843ab2b4a415ff4c1b33508a5c7bbbe8d1116c/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1193.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1193","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1193.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be9b320c2a949cb73c32157503bdf6fad99f369e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1193.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/irix_copilot.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-7vqx-v439-rx3w/GHSA-7vqx-v439-rx3w.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1193.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a1bc3159-dc2d-4684-9081-e8182fff3cbe.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/irix_copilot.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0838.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0932","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0932.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1190","title":"imwheel imwheel-solo 本地符号链接任意文件修改漏洞","description":"imwheel 套件中的 imwheel-solo 是一个 SUID Perl 脚本，存在一个危险的符号链接漏洞。攻击者能够通过精心 crafted 的 .imwheelrc 文件（或相关临时文件）创建指向敏感文件（如 /etc/shadow、/etc/passwd 等）的符号链接，当 imwheel-solo 脚本在处理这些文件时，将导致系统权限用户实际修改这些关键系统文件。漏洞原理在于脚本未充分验证目标文件的真实路径，而是直接打开并写入用户控制的路径。具体影响方面，任何本地用户均可利用此漏洞修改系统关键配置文件，潜在后果包括：破坏系统安全（修改密码文件）、破坏服务配置（权限提升）、数据破坏或导致系统服务崩溃。攻击条件要求攻击者首先获得本地用户权限，通常通过其他漏洞或社会工程学手段实现，这类攻击通常通过辅助工具（如编译自定义 payload）结合定时任务或登录后执行链实现。利用方式上，攻击者需要先分析目标系统的 .imwheelrc 文件权限和位置，精心设计恶意符号链接路径，利用 imwheel-solo 的 SU 权限触发写入操作，因此这是典型的本地提权漏洞，危害等级为低至中（CVSS v2.0 评分为 2.1），影响系统完整性和机密性。官方补丁通常建议升级到安全版本并修改 imwheel-solo 的权限配置，或直接禁用其 SU 权限以消除风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1190"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-08-31","updated":"2001-08-31","remediation":"立即升级 imwheel 至修复版本（Red Hat 已发布 RHSA-2000:016 安全公告，对应 imwheel 补丁版本）。如无法升级，可删除 imwheel-solo 的 suid 位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/imwheel-solo），或直接卸载 imwheel 软件包以消除攻击面。临时缓解措施包括确保 .imwheelrc 文件所在目录仅由可信用户管理。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27eee309d10a00ce5571c5ab1765599e23f1725f/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1190.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1190","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-1190.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1190.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/b21976b5bf1b11783559cbe4f375f11636b79518/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pwgx-pv8v-3hcp/GHSA-pwgx-pv8v-3hcp.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88540/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1190.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151200_151300.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/864adb9ddf294417a5a4e84f90f9adf54e9dca89/2000.tsv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--f29c72cc-43ac-4c3b-9b11-8ec2972ce55c.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0932.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0840","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0840.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1198","title":"Qualcomm qpopper 锁文件拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Qualcomm qpopper POP 邮件服务器在创建邮箱锁文件时使用可预测的锁定文件名，导致本地攻击者可以通过提前创建其他用户邮箱的锁文件阻止合法用户访问邮件，从而引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Qualcomm qpopper 2.53/3.0 版本以及 RedHat imap 4.5 和 UoW imap 4.5 中的 popd 组件。攻击者无需特殊权限即可实施攻击。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1198"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-31","updated":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 qpopper 到 4.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复锁文件随机化机制；如软件已停止维护，建议迁移至 Dovecot、Cyrus 等受支持的 POP3 服务；临时缓解措施包括移除受影响用户的 shell 登录权限以消除本地攻击面，并限制 /var/lock 目录的写入权限仅允许 pop 守护进程用户访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95624629924545&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95634229925906&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1132","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19869","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f655f864c18bd25e1fca21f5741c644854233bf0/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1198.json","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2000-1198"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0840.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0996","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0996.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0892","title":"Telnet 客户端 信息泄露漏洞","description":"部分 Telnet 客户端存在信息泄露漏洞，远程 Telnet 服务器可通过协议中的环境变量选项向客户端请求环境变量，而某些客户端实现未对该请求进行适当限制或告警，会将本地环境变量（如 PATH、HOME、USER、DISPLAY 等）响应给远程服务器，导致敏感配置信息泄露。此外，攻击者还可通过构造包含 telnet: URL 的恶意网页，诱使用户点击后自动连接恶意 Telnet 服务器。用户只需连接到不受信任的 Telnet 服务器或访问包含 telnet: URL 的恶意页面，即可在不需身份认证的情况下泄露客户端环境中的敏感信息，进而为后续定向攻击提供辅助情报。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0892"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-07-21T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:41.357","remediation":"禁用 Telnet 客户端的环境变量回显功能，或在 Telnet 客户端配置中关闭 REQUEST 环境变量选项。具体操作：在使用 Telnet 客户端时，通过设置环境变量 TELNET_OPTS=-E 或在客户端配置文件中添加 disable-env-request 选项，阻止远程服务器请求客户端环境变量。对于 Windows 系统，可通过组策略禁用 Telnet 客户端的远程环境变量查询功能；Linux 系统可编辑 /etc/telnet.cfg 或客户端配置文件添加相应禁用选项。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/22404","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6644","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2000/CVE-2000-0892.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b7ad02cdea30b1d567c45050de3359436fcc903a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0892.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0892","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0892.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0892.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/812e13284092701ac2e48a9865618a02a3b2d95e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-f8g7-fg99-vggp/GHSA-f8g7-fg99-vggp.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151000_151100.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/ebc4d73723464668b97400aaa2d8410c6ff78a81/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0892.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/71599ef996ac7c3f46a42cd5f524fb7576cf8be7/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0892.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0996.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0995","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0995.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0891","title":"IBM Lotus Notes 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"IBM Lotus Notes 在 5.02 版本之前存在默认 ECL（可执行内容语言）配置缺陷，允许远程攻击者通过在电子邮件中附加恶意程序，利用当用户打开邮件时自动执行该附件的方式，在目标系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Lotus Notes 5.02 之前的所有版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可触发，危害等级较高。用户只需打开钓鱼邮件中的附件即可被利用，Microsoft 已于相关安全更新中修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0891"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-07-21T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:41.237","remediation":"升级到 Lotus Notes 5.02 或更高版本，该版本已修复默认 ECL 的过度授权问题。升级完成后，对每个用户的 .id 文件执行以下操作：运行 Notes，选择 File -> Tools -> Switch ID 切换到目标 .id 文件，然后选择 File -> Tools -> User Preferences，点击 Security Options 进入工作站安全 ECL 对话框，选择默认模板并取消所有权限勾选，点击 Add 将可信开发者添加到白名单并为其单独配置所需权限。如暂时无法升级，可将所有表单和邮件的 ECL 设置为\"无签名\"并取消所有文件系统访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/5962","http://www.notes.net/R5FixList.nsf/Search%21SearchView&Query=CBAT45TU9S","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5045","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0ff539514ffae70ea73031a227022cb4e6068a50/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0891.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0891","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e10c449b2000a2439910055eb21748030356eb7d/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0891.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e8cef73228affbb0d7f27f3d9e33baf98c2660a4/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0891.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/812e13284092701ac2e48a9865618a02a3b2d95e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mwxq-5whq-6gjx/GHSA-mwxq-5whq-6gjx.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0891.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151000_151100.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--60a12890-1045-457d-9c55-b711600fcfbe.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0995.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0900","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0900.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0348","title":"SCO UnixWare sendmail.cf 权限提升漏洞","description":"SCO UnixWare 7.1.0 及更早版本中默认安装的 Sendmail 配置文件 sendmail.cf 存在权限配置缺陷，本地攻击者可利用该漏洞提升至 root 权限。攻击者通过构造特制的配置文件或利用 Sendmail 运行时的特权操作，可完全控制系统，造成机密性、完整性和可用性全部丧失。CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0348"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:31.803","remediation":"立即从 SCO 官方 FTP 获取安全公告 SB-99.10a 中提供的补丁，更新 sendmail.cf 配置文件以修复权限配置缺陷。具体操作：下载补丁后执行 `scoadmin` 应用补丁包，或手动替换 `/etc/mail/sendmail.cf` 为加固版本并重启 sendmail 服务（`/etc/init.d/mail stop/start`）。由于 SCO UnixWare 7.1.0 及更早版本已停止官方支持，建议尽快迁移至受支持的 Unix/Linux 发行版以获取持续安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0348.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0348","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0348.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0348.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-62pv-x977-5p4f/GHSA-62pv-x977-5p4f.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88295/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0348.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/48d9bee10ba6f9c95b14d9de429f21fee40e28eb/2000.tsv","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_gainpre.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0900.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0808","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0808.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0308","title":"SCO UnixWare Netscape 服务器权限提升漏洞","description":"SCO UnixWare 7.0.x 及 2.1.3 系统中 Netscape FastTrack Server 2.x、Enterprise Server 2.0 和 Proxy Server 2.5 的安装文件权限设置不当，导致本地攻击者可通过访问权限过高的敏感文件或目录获取 root 权限。该漏洞源于软件安装过程中未正确限制文件访问权限，攻击者无需认证即可利用此缺陷实现权限提升，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。建议升级至修复版本或手动修正文件权限。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0308"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:26.753","remediation":"升级至 Netscape FastTrack Server 3.0 及以上版本。对无法升级的系统，立即修复文件权限：以 root 执行 `chmod 755 /opt/netsuite/suitespot/bin` 及 `chmod 644 /opt/netsuite/suitespot/*.conf`，移除不必要的 setuid 二进制文件，并将敏感目录属主改为 `nobody`。在 /etc/inetd.conf 中禁用不必要的 Netscape 服务端口作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/362345baaa3b0376b2369a7901885756e250334b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0308.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0308","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0308.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0308.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-qwxm-r9mr-vq2h/GHSA-qwxm-r9mr-vq2h.json","https://github.com/NetBSD/pkgsrc-wip/blob/7db1c0aca641164bcc9422b571eb34ddf2f0494c/sara/PLIST","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150600_150700.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0308.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--3ba2bd6a-56d3-4758-a3b9-f10406d45458.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0808.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0392","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0392.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0375","title":"FreeBSD kernel 符号链接跟随本地任意文件修改漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 3.2 内核在生成进程崩溃转储（core dump）文件时未正确处理符号链接，未正确检查目标文件路径是否为符号链接，导致本地攻击者可通过在受影响目录中预先创建符号链接，诱使内核将 core dump 数据写入任意文件，从而实现任意文件内容覆盖或篡改。该漏洞影响 FreeBSD 3.2 版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，利用难度较低，可导致系统文件完整性破坏或权限提升。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0375"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:35.147","remediation":"升级 FreeBSD 至 3.3 或更高版本，该漏洞已在 FreeBSD-SA-00:17 安全公告中修复。如无法升级，可通过在 /etc/sysctl.conf 中添加 kern.coredump=0 禁用 core dump 功能，或使用 chmod 1777 设置 core dump 目录权限防止符号链接攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/6084","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0375.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0375","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0375.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0375.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9608541b971a314a928294c8f88371b45ef3f307/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wqf6-fx9r-6p5h/GHSA-wqf6-fx9r-6p5h.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0375.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/f352dfaf39e3e89c1c3ab384d9e74e4219126910/2000.tsv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--0a4092b0-9a32-44f2-96f2-70daf0d86af8.owl","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-2000.jsonl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0392.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0383","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0383.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0368","title":"Cisco IOS 命令历史记录敏感信息泄露漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 9.1及之后版本存在敏感信息泄露漏洞。具有登录提示符访问权限的攻击者可通过查看历史命令记录获取先前用户输入的命令片段，从而窃取可能包含密码、配置信息等敏感数据。该漏洞源于系统未正确清除命令历史缓冲区，攻击条件为需要本地访问权限，利用难度较低，可导致部分机密性损失。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0368"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:34.267","remediation":"升级 Cisco IOS 至 12.0 及以上版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法升级，可在全局配置模式下使用 `no service password-recovery` 命令禁用密码恢复功能，并限制物理控制台访问权限，仅允许授权管理员通过 SSH 登录，同时配置 `exec-timeout` 自动注销空闲会话以防止历史命令泄露。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/j-009.shtml","http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/770/ioshist-pub.shtml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-0368.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0368.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0368","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0368.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0368.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/74884340187670a91b9d5bdb799b52e73426ad63/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fxrh-cvvm-q99f/GHSA-fxrh-cvvm-q99f.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88326/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0368.